`,(0,d.jsx)(b3.h2,{children:"Conclusion"}),`
`,(0,d.jsx)(b3.p,{children:"Exciting to run Windows on my Mac without having to buy a new PC! Still exploring what I can do with my VMs, both the server and Windows client. I'm planning to set up a VLAN with my Ubuntu server, Mac host and Windows 11 VM."}),`
